    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1replication_1_1_compressed_replication_stream" kindref="compound">CompressedReplicationStream</ref></para>
<para>Wraps a replication batch before sending and decompresses on receive. Supported algorithms: NONE, LZ4 (fast), ZSTD (best ratio), SNAPPY (fastest). AUTO selects ZSTD for batches &gt;= min_batch_size, otherwise NONE. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
